# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to Qiskit {#introduction-to-qiskit}"
msgstr "Pengantar Qiskit {#introduction-to-qiskit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The name \"Qiskit\" is a general term referring to a collection of software for executing programs on quantum computers. Most notable among these software tools is the open-source Qiskit SDK, and the runtime environment, accessed using IBM Quantum Compute Service (formerly known as the Qiskit Runtime Service), through which you can execute workloads on IBM&reg; quantum processing units (QPUs). As quantum technology evolves, so does Qiskit, with new capabilities released every year that expand this core collection of quantum software.\n"
msgstr "Nama \"Qiskit\" adalah istilah umum untuk kumpulan software yang dipakai menjalankan program di komputer kuantum. Yang paling menonjol di antara perangkat software ini adalah Qiskit SDK yang open-source, dan lingkungan runtime, yang diakses lewat IBM Quantum Compute Service (dulu dikenal sebagai Qiskit Runtime Service), tempat kamu bisa menjalankan workload di quantum processing unit (QPU) IBM&reg;. Seiring berkembangnya teknologi kuantum, Qiskit juga ikut berkembang, dengan kemampuan baru yang dirilis setiap tahun untuk memperluas kumpulan inti software kuantum ini.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In addition, many open-source projects are part of the broader Qiskit ecosystem. These software tools are not part of Qiskit itself, but rather interface with Qiskit and can provide valuable additional functionality.\n"
msgstr "Selain itu, banyak proyek open-source yang menjadi bagian dari ekosistem Qiskit yang lebih luas. Perangkat software ini bukan bagian dari Qiskit itu sendiri, tetapi terhubung dengan Qiskit dan bisa memberikan fungsionalitas tambahan yang berguna.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM is committed to the responsible development of quantum computing. Learn more and review our responsible quantum principles in the [Responsible quantum computing](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/responsible-quantum-computing) topic.\n"
msgstr "IBM berkomitmen pada pengembangan komputasi kuantum yang bertanggung jawab. Pelajari lebih lanjut dan tinjau prinsip kuantum yang bertanggung jawab milik kami di topik [Komputasi kuantum yang bertanggung jawab](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/responsible-quantum-computing).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Qiskit SDK {#the-qiskit-sdk}"
msgstr "Qiskit SDK {#the-qiskit-sdk}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Qiskit SDK (package name [`qiskit`](https://pypi.org/project/qiskit/)) is an open-source SDK for working with quantum computers at the level of extended (static, dynamic, and scheduled) quantum circuits, operators, and primitives. This library is the core component of Qiskit; it is the largest package under the Qiskit name with the broadest suite of tools for quantum computation, and many other components interface with it.\n"
msgstr "Qiskit SDK (nama paket [`qiskit`](https://pypi.org/project/qiskit/)) adalah SDK open-source untuk bekerja dengan komputer kuantum pada level circuit kuantum yang diperluas (statis, dinamis, dan terjadwal), operator, dan primitive. Pustaka ini adalah komponen inti Qiskit; ini paket terbesar dengan nama Qiskit dan memiliki rangkaian alat terlengkap untuk komputasi kuantum, dan banyak komponen lain terhubung dengannya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Some of the most useful features of the Qiskit SDK include:\n"
msgstr "Beberapa fitur Qiskit SDK yang paling berguna antara lain:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Circuit-building tools** ([`qiskit.circuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit)) - For initializing and manipulating registers, circuits, instructions, gates, parameters, and control flow objects.\n"
msgstr "**Alat pembuat Circuit** ([`qiskit.circuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit)) - Untuk menginisialisasi dan memanipulasi register, circuit, instruksi, gate, parameter, dan objek control flow.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Circuit library** ([`qiskit.circuit.library`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit_library)) - A vast range of circuits, instructions, and gates - key building blocks for circuit-based quantum computations.\n"
msgstr "**Pustaka Circuit** ([`qiskit.circuit.library`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit_library)) - Beragam circuit, instruksi, dan gate - blok bangunan utama untuk komputasi kuantum berbasis circuit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Quantum info library** ([`qiskit.quantum_info`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/quantum_info)) - A toolkit for working with quantum states, operators and channels, using exact calculations (no sampling noise). Use this module to specify input observables and analyze fidelity of outputs from primitives queries.\n"
msgstr "**Pustaka Quantum info** ([`qiskit.quantum_info`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/quantum_info)) - Toolkit untuk bekerja dengan state, operator, dan channel kuantum, memakai perhitungan eksak (tanpa noise sampling). Pakai modul ini untuk menentukan observable input dan menganalisis fidelity output dari query primitive.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Transpiler** ([`qiskit.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler)) - For transforming and adapting quantum circuits to suit specific device topology, and optimizing for execution on real quantum processing units (QPUs).\n"
msgstr "**Transpiler** ([`qiskit.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler)) - Untuk mengubah dan menyesuaikan circuit kuantum agar cocok dengan topologi perangkat tertentu, serta mengoptimalkannya untuk dijalankan di quantum processing unit (QPU) sungguhan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Primitives** ([`qiskit.primitives`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/primitives)) - The module that contains the base definitions and reference implementations of the Sampler and Estimator primitives, from which different quantum hardware providers can derive their own implementations. See more information about the IBM Quantum primitives [in the documentation](/guides/qiskit-runtime-primitives).\n"
msgstr "**Primitive** ([`qiskit.primitives`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/primitives)) - Modul yang berisi definisi dasar dan implementasi referensi dari primitive Sampler dan Estimator, yang bisa dijadikan turunan oleh berbagai penyedia hardware kuantum untuk membuat implementasi mereka sendiri. Lihat informasi lebih lanjut tentang primitive IBM Quantum [di dokumentasi](/guides/qiskit-runtime-primitives).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
