# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a more detailed introduction to installing the Qiskit SDK, check out the [installation page](/guides/install-qiskit). If you're ready to install it now, simply run:\n"
msgstr "Untuk pengantar yang lebih rinci tentang cara menginstal Qiskit SDK, lihat [halaman instalasi](/guides/install-qiskit). Kalau kamu sudah siap menginstalnya sekarang, tinggal jalankan:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Benchmarking {#benchmarking}"
msgstr "Benchmarking {#benchmarking}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Benchmarking is important for comparing the relative performance of quantum software across different stages of a development workflow. Benchmarking tests for quantum software might, for example, look at the speed and quality of building, manipulating, and transpiling circuits. IBM Quantum is committed to delivering the most performant SDK possible, and to that end, the Qiskit SDK is benchmarked using over 1,000 tests developed by leading universities, national labs, and researchers at IBM. The benchmarking suite used for these tests, named Benchpress, is now available as [an open-source package](https://github.com/qiskit/benchpress). You can now use the Benchpress package to perform your own analysis of quantum SDK performance.\n"
msgstr "Benchmarking penting untuk membandingkan performa relatif software kuantum di berbagai tahap alur kerja pengembangan. Tes benchmarking untuk software kuantum bisa, misalnya, melihat kecepatan dan kualitas membangun, memanipulasi, dan men-transpile circuit. IBM Quantum berkomitmen menghadirkan SDK dengan performa terbaik, dan untuk itu, Qiskit SDK di-benchmark memakai lebih dari 1.000 tes yang dikembangkan oleh universitas terkemuka, laboratorium nasional, dan peneliti di IBM. Suite benchmarking yang dipakai untuk tes ini, bernama Benchpress, sekarang tersedia sebagai [paket open-source](https://github.com/qiskit/benchpress). Sekarang kamu bisa memakai paket Benchpress untuk melakukan analisis sendiri terhadap performa SDK kuantum.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah berikutnya {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - Learn about the library of circuits and instructions available in the Qiskit [circuit library](/guides/circuit-library).\n"
"  - Read about the Qiskit transpiler and the many options for transpilation in the [Transpiler](/guides/transpile) section.\n"
"  - Find out how to use the [primitive interface](/guides/primitives) to streamline quantum programming.\n"
"  - Check out the [Qiskit ecosystem](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/ecosystem) which hosts open-source projects interfacing and extending the functionality of Qiskit\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"
"  - Pelajari pustaka circuit dan instruksi yang tersedia di [pustaka circuit](/guides/circuit-library) Qiskit.\n"
"  - Baca tentang Transpiler Qiskit dan beragam opsi transpilasi di bagian [Transpiler](/guides/transpile).\n"
"  - Cari tahu cara memakai [antarmuka primitive](/guides/primitives) untuk menyederhanakan pemrograman kuantum.\n"
"  - Lihat [ekosistem Qiskit](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/ecosystem) yang menaungi proyek open-source yang terhubung dengan dan memperluas fungsionalitas Qiskit\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
